---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <section class="section px-0">
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center place-items-center gap-8">
      <div class="flex flex-row gap-10">
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold">NeonRush</h1>
        <a
          href="https://banishlight.itch.io/neonrush"
          class="hover:scale-115 transition-all"
          target="_blank"
        >
          <img src="/itchio.svg" class="w-14" />
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="text-left flex flex-col gap-4 md:max-w-5xl">
        <p>
          A game developed in Unreal Engine, it won the Winter Games Voter's
          Choice Awards
        </p>
        <p>
          I worked on this game as a Test Lead. My job was to gather testers to
          play the game and compile data on how the game could be improved upon
          for further development.
        </p>
        <p>
          What I did was let the beta testers play the game freely without any
          instructions coming directly from me and I would take notes, just as
          an observer, even if they asked me for help or guides. If they found
          anything from the UI, controllers, or general gameplay confusing even
          with the in-game tutorial, we would make the changes accordingly to
          make it easier to understand in further testing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="md:hidden flex">
        <iframe
          width="360"
          height="215"
          src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/KRMvcCpMPc0?si=c8IvGLEcttcJfXa3"
          title="YouTube video player"
          frameborder="0"
          allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
          referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
          allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>

      <div class="hidden md:flex">
        <iframe
          width="860"
          height="515"
          src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/KRMvcCpMPc0?si=c8IvGLEcttcJfXa3"
          title="YouTube video player"
          frameborder="0"
          allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
          referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
          allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
